        description:
          "Cybersecurity is the practice of protecting computers, networks, systems, and data from threats, unauthorized access, and attacks — ensuring the confidentiality, integrity, and availability of digital assets.",
        keyPoints: [
          "Prevents data breaches that expose personal/business information",
          "Protects financial transactions from fraud and theft",
          "Ensures business continuity by preventing disruptive cyberattacks",
